{"root_text": {"uid": "ja86", "lang": "si", "is_root": false, "title": "ශීලවිමංස ජාතකය", "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "next": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "Omens ", "uid": "ja87"}, "previous": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "The Unknown Fruit ", "uid": "ja85"}, "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset='UTF-8'>\n<meta name='author' content='A.P. de Zoysa'>\n<title></title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article id='ja86' lang='si'>\n<header>\n<ul>\n<li class='division'>ඛුද්දකනිකාය</li>\n<li class='subdivision'>ජාතක</li>\n<li>(පඨමො භාගො)</li>\n<li>1. එකක නිපාතය</li>\n<li class='vagga'>9. අපායිම්හ වර්ගය</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>86. ශීලවිමංස ජාතකය</h1>\n</header>\n<p><a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv86' href='#msdiv86'>Msdiv 86</a>“ශීලයම යහපත්වේ. ලෝකයෙහි ශීලය උතුම්ය. බලව, ඝොරවූ විෂ ඇති සර්පතෙම සිල්වත් වෙමියි අනුන්ට හිංසාවක් නොකෙරේයයි” කීයේය.</p>\n<p class='endsutta'>සීලවීමංසකජාතකං ඡට්ඨං.</p>\n<footer>\n<p><span class='author'>AP de Zoysa</span> edition.</p>\n<p>Permission to publish was kindly granted by Kumari Jayawardhana.</p>\n<p>Digital files were kindly supplied by Sirisumana Godage of <a href='http://www.godage.com/'>Godage International Publishing</a>, who publish a print edition of this text.</p>\n<p>Conversion from PDF was by Janaka of <a href='http://pitaka.lk/'>http://pitaka.lk/</a>.</p>\n<p>The assistance of Amaradasa Liyanagamage, Ven Mettavihari and Maithri Panagoda is gratefully acknowledged.</p>\n<p>Prepared for SuttaCentral by <span class='editor'>Ayya Kathrin Vimalañāṇī</span>.</p>\n</footer>\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}, "translation": {"uid": "ja86", "lang": "si", "is_root": false, "title": "ශීලවිමංස ජාතකය", "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "next": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "Omens ", "uid": "ja87"}, "previous": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "The Unknown Fruit ", "uid": "ja85"}, "text": "<!DOCTYPE htm